  <h2 id="skills">Skills that actually move the pay needle</h2>

  <p>
    A branch cutoff or a college name explains almost none of that Rs 3 LPA to Rs 18 LPA+ spread. The
    skills in the table below explain nearly all of it, regardless of which electrical seat you land in.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
